      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/f6c823/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2019-03-18T18:00:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So I'm prepping to run the intro 5-shot, and I have questions about how boosts are handled:</p>\n<p>1) Unity can destroy a bonus to boost her spawns.&nbsp; Can she use one that's already been used?&nbsp; The dice mod only lasts one turn but fluff-wise the thing which gave the boost is still there.</p>\n<p>2) Wraith's Inventory Barrage - it says to destroy and use all her bonuses, but again, what happens with \"used\" bonuses here?</p>\n<p>3) Wraith's Favorite Knife - this is Persistent, but not Exclusive - once she hits Red can she just stack 'favorite knives' indefinitely?</p>\n<p>4) Baron Blade's status is based on how many invention-based bonuses or penalties.&nbsp; Do used ones coubt?&nbsp; Or does he have to sit on the unused (and basically waste actions) to improve his status?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:52:34.211Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
