      "created_at": "2019-03-18T18:44:14.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Unless a bonus is Persistent, I believe after one use the boost is then gone..</p>\n<p>Like say for example I made an electric hero who can boost my ally's by charging their fists. Once my ally attacks with that, the charge is used up and gone. No more boost.</p>",
