      "username": "MindWanderer",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
      "created_at": "2019-03-18T19:48:55.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>No, once it's been used it no longer exists.&nbsp; RP-wise the \"thing\" may still exist but the bonus does not and thus cannot be consumed or counted for some other purpose.</p>\n<p>And yes, bonuses which are persistent but not exclusive can stack with themselves.&nbsp; It seems like all such abilities are Red, and you aren't likely to be in Red for very long, so it's not a big deal.</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:59:47.450Z",
