      "user_title": "",
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>No, once it's been used it no longer exists.&nbsp; RP-wise the \"thing\" may still exist but the bonus does not and thus cannot be consumed or counted for some other purpose.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>And yes, bonuses which are persistent but not exclusive can stack with themselves.&nbsp; It seems like all such abilities are Red, and you aren't likely to be in Red for very long, so it's not a big deal.</p>",
